# CR 701.27f limits only an ability transforming its own permanent. Panharmonicon makes The Golden-Gear Colossus's enters
# ability trigger twice (CR 603.2d), both aimed at Dire Flail: "transform up to one other target double-faced artifact you
# control". The first turns Dire Flail into Dire Blunderbuss; the second is an ability of the Colossus, not of the
# Blunderbuss, so the transform in between does not stop it, and the Blunderbuss turns back into Dire Flail. Each makes two
# Gnomes.

